Package: serk-finance
Version: @DEBVERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Serk Technologies Group <packaging@serk-finance.invalid>
Depends: adduser, curl, systemd
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Egziu/serk-finance
Description: IFRS-based accounting for Ethiopia and Africa (office server)
 Serk Finance with its own PostgreSQL database and web interface: double-entry ledger with
 maker-checker approval, sales, purchases, inventory, payroll, VAT, Ethiopian fiscal year,
 year-end close, audit trail and an optional AI assistant that prepares drafts only.
 Open http://localhost:8080 after installation to create your company.
